  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vocational Literacy Program for Poverty Reduction (VOLIP)- Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to help reduce poverty, particularly among rural youth and women by (i) equipping them with relevant functional literacy competencies and basic practical skills and (iii) providing them access to microfinance schemes to enable them to improve their own development.</narrative>
